     SUITL1   GT(NUM($HAND),$SUIT)                          :F(RETURN)
<<< NO SYNTACTIC ERROR >>>

              SUITL  =  SUITL  $(NUM($HAND) - $SUIT)
<<< SYNTACTIC ERROR >>>

              $HAND  =  DIFFER(NEXT($HAND))  NEXT($HAND) :S(SUITL1)F(RETURN)
<<< NO SYNTACTIC ERROR >>>

